{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a two-player game played on a single computer, where each player controls rods to hit the soccer ball into the opponent\u2019s goal and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an \u201cimpostor control\u201d mechanic, where neither player can control their own defensive rods \u2014 only the opponent can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features frictionless, fully elastic collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is merely my undergraduate graduation project. If the sales exceed $2 million, I will create a world-changing VR game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644530?t=1746597081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644530?t=1746597081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644530/4a3d409a7c10fb42516457a6621b8906eca1de30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746597081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644530/4a3d409a7c10fb42516457a6621b8906eca1de30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746597081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a two-player game played on a single computer, where each player controls rods to hit the soccer ball into the opponent\u2019s goal and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an \u201cimpostor control\u201d mechanic, where neither player can control their own defensive rods \u2014 only the opponent can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features frictionless, fully elastic collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is merely my